            0.639
          ],
          "content": "17. (1) 计算: $(x + 1)(x - 1) + x(2 - x)$. (2) 解不等式组: $\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} 4x - 3 > 9 \\\\ 2 + x \\geqslant 0 \\end{array} \\right.$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.06,
            0.642,
            0.458,
            0.709
          ],
          "content": "[答案]:【小问1详解】解: 原式 $= x^{2} - 1 + 2x - x^{2} = 2x - 1$; 【小问2详解】解: $\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l}4x - 3 > 9(1) \\\\ 2 + x \\geqslant 0(2) \\end{array} \\right.$, 解不等式(1), 得 $x > 3$, 解不等式(2), 得 $x \\geqslant -2$, 所以原不等式组的解是 $x > 3$. [解析]:"
        },
